			"notes": "### 更新內容\n\n- 新增：NPC 對話一開始就是譯文，不再先閃出幾個英文字；就地取代模式在認出那句之前先蓋住原文（最多約 0.3 秒），可在 F6 關掉。\n- 修正：另開的對話小框打字途中不再閃爍、收掉又出現。\n- 修正：就地取代模式的譯文出字更平均，句中有數字或地名時不再停住再一口氣跳出一大段。\n- 修正：對話框下方的提示列翻譯後不再往右偏（感謝 anilken）。\n- 變更：翻譯每一幀的負擔變輕，FPS 更穩。\n- 譯文：七種語言補上 An Unexpected Departure、The Price of Ingenuity、Through the Pipes 與兩個秘密故事；繁中的數值範圍一律寫「到」。\n\n### What's new\n\n- Added: NPC dialogue starts in the translation instead of flashing a few English characters first; in the replace mode the box stays blank until the line is recognised (about 0.3s at most). Can be turned off in F6.\n- Fixed: the separate dialogue panel no longer flashes or closes and reopens while a line is being typed.\n- Fixed: translated dialogue in the replace mode types out more evenly; lines with numbers or place names no longer pause and then jump ahead.\n- Fixed: the hint bar under the dialogue box no longer shifts to the right when the hint is translated (thanks anilken).\n- Changed: translating costs less per frame, for steadier FPS.\n- Translations: An Unexpected Departure, The Price of Ingenuity, Through the Pipes and two secret stories in all seven languages; Traditional Chinese ranges read 到 everywhere."
		},
