			"notes": "### 更新內容\n\n- 修正：句中夾著元素圖示的對話（Detlas 士兵）兩種對話模式都會翻，圖示留在原位、每個詞照元素上色；譯文裡的顏色標記在就地取代模式不再直接顯示成文字。\n- 修正：實況模式上方的狀態列，網址的亮光照常掃過，不再整段跳色。\n- 修正：物品權重區塊最長的那一行，百分比也對齊同一欄。\n- 變更：中文的 Lootrun 改稱掠奪長征（簡中掠夺长征），設定畫面也一起改。\n- 譯文：韓俄西土任務對話照故事導讀重新校對，七種語言補上鋼鐵同心、三個秘密故事與 Espren 的 NPC，補上更多掠奪長征的加持、卡片與名牌。\n\n### What's new\n\n- Fixed: dialogue lines with element icons in the middle (Detlas soldier) are translated in both dialogue modes, with the icons in place and each word in its element colour; colour marks in translations no longer show up as text in the replace mode.\n- Fixed: the streamer mode boss bar keeps the moving highlight on the server address instead of flashing.\n- Fixed: item weight percentages line up even on the longest weight label.\n- Changed: Chinese calls Lootrun 掠奪長征 (Simplified 掠夺长征), settings screen included.\n- Translations: Korean, Russian, Spanish and Turkish quest dialogue reread against the story guide, Solidarity of Steel, three secret stories and Espren NPCs in all languages, more Lootrun boons, cards and nameplates."
		},
