			"notes": "### 更新內容\n\n- 修正：新版 Lootrun 試煉卡與使命卡的標題（例如 Hubris、Equilibrium）照「內容名稱」設定顯示，不再留英文或變成裝備名。\n- 譯文：照劇情典故重譯一批物品的 lore 與名稱（凋零首、Redbeard、Ba'al 等），繁中下界裝備改稱地獄、Discoverer 改為逐富，補上試煉卡與礦車的句子、yool141 的日文任務台詞，以及實機收到的新句子。\n\n### What's new\n\n- Fixed: the titles of the new Lootrun trial and mission cards (such as Hubris and Equilibrium) follow the content name setting instead of staying English or showing a gear name.\n- Translations: item lore and names retranslated from the story (Witherhead, Redbeard, Ba'al and others), Traditional Chinese Nether gear uses 地獄, Discoverer is 逐富, new trial and minecart lines, Japanese quest lines from yool141, and new lines recorded in game."
		},
